[{:db/id -1, :doc/id "doc-ipni-maturity-iteration-02", :doc/title "IPNI maturity — Co-Scientist iteration 02", :doc/path "90-docs/ipni_maturity/iteration-02.edn", :source/dataset "ipni-maturity", :doc/measured-at "2026-09-01T18:54:53Z", :doc/score 97.52066115702479, :doc/body "# IPNI maturity — Co-Scientist iteration 02\n\n> Judge: `ipni-maturity.audit` over `ipni-maturity.probe` — measured HTTP\n> statuses and manifest facts, no LLM. Ranking: `kaizen.elo`, round-robin,\n> the measured gain is the judge.\n>\n> Probed 2026-09-01T18:54:53Z. 100.00% of the rubric was measurable; nothing was unmeasurable, so nothing is excluded.\n\n## Score\n\n**97.52 / 100**\n\n## Findings (heaviest recoverable headroom first)\n\n| axis | weight | finding |\n|---|---|---|\n| `entries-hamt` | 0.03 | ipni.hamt returns :not-yet-implemented — honest, but caps an advertisement at one EntryChunk |\n\n## Roadmap (Elo)\n\n| Elo | id | axis | startable? | observable? | +gain |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1200 | `ipni-h-entries-hamt` | `entries-hamt` | yes | no | +2.48 |\n\n## Meta\n\n**The batch is empty.** Reachable without unblocking: **97.52 / 100** — which is where the score already is.\n\nThat is not an empty backlog. `evolve` batches only `:low`-risk work and defers\nonly `:blocked` work, so `:medium`-effort hypotheses land in neither list while\nstaying startable and on the roadmap: **`ipni-h-entries-hamt`**.\n\nAn empty batch is also not a batch of invisible work, and this section used to\nprint the second when it meant the first: `(some :observable? [])` is falsey, so\nhaving nothing batched rendered as the loop's strongest warning next to a gain\nof +0.00.\n\n## Method note\n\nThree earlier versions of the probe swept `orgs/` directly for call sites; on 4,400\ncheckouts none finished, and each reported the two heaviest axes as `:unknown`. The\nworking version derives them instead: a namespace cannot be required without its\ndependency on the classpath, so zero declarations across 4321 repos (3595 manifests read) implies zero call\nsites. The evidence floor is reported so 0 hits cannot be read as 0 looked at.\n"}]